Subject: [PATCH] pigeon: mark the version 10.20261006-pigeon2

Not for upstream. Build/Version.hs reads the first CHANGELOG entry.

---
--- a/CHANGELOG
+++ b/CHANGELOG
@@ -1,3 +1,14 @@
+git-annex (10.20261006-pigeon2) pigeon; urgency=medium
+
+  * pigeon's build of 10.20261006, from third_party/git-annex in
+    https://github.com/dont-feed-the/pigeon.
+  * CHECKPRESENT respects removal locks and CONNECTDONE follows all
+    relayed git output, preserving the two P2P fixes from pigeon1.
+  * whereis --no-urls reports the same location UUIDs and trust classes
+    without querying download URLs, for bounded metadata consumers.
+
+ -- Pigeon contributors  Sun, 18 Oct 2026 20:00:00 +0000
+
 git-annex (10.20261006) upstream; urgency=medium
 
   * Fix stack build.
